          "order": 3,
          "title": "The Synthesis",
          "headline": "The recurring problem was disciplined transformation.",
          "summary": "Research method, formal grammar, agentic computation, software practice, and systems engineering converge around a shared problem: how transformation remains legible, testable, and repairable.",
          "visualMode": "sequence",
          "layoutPreset": "many-to-one-convergence",
